WEBVTT

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:05.040
When the cataclysm started,

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:09.500
Sawatari and I exited Academia's underground
 training facility, heading for the surface.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:12.110
Inside the Fusion Dimension's ruined city,

00:00:12.110 --> 00:00:14.560
we found Edo and Sora, wounded.

00:00:15.110 --> 00:00:17.760
From what they said, the cataclysm

00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:23.240
was caused by Leo Akaba's initiation 
of the dimensional unification.

00:00:23.240 --> 00:00:27.790
And the one who destroyed the 
city was a fusion of Yuya,

00:00:27.790 --> 00:00:34.040
Ute, Hugo, Joeri, and their dragons, 
known as Supreme King Z-ARC.

00:00:38.310 --> 00:00:44.010
Edo and Sora fought, believing that Yuya 
remained, somewhere within Z-ARC.

00:00:44.010 --> 00:00:46.890
But his overwhelming power destroyed them.

00:00:47.290 --> 00:00:50.600
And now, once again, Kurosaki and Kaito...

00:00:52.480 --> 00:00:55.200
I activate Action Spell Miracle!

00:00:55.520 --> 00:00:58.170
I activate Action Spell Evasion!

00:00:58.170 --> 00:01:03.740
I negate cards acquired in a phase 
other than the Draw Phase,

00:01:03.740 --> 00:01:05.640
and destroy them!

00:01:12.400 --> 00:01:13.990
Even Action Cards...

00:01:14.270 --> 00:01:17.190
Begone from my sight!

00:01:28.760 --> 00:01:31.540
But we cannot afford to give up!

00:01:32.100 --> 00:01:33.630
Wait for me, Yuya.

00:01:33.630 --> 00:01:37.310
If your heart is still locked within 
Z-ARC, then I and...

00:01:37.310 --> 00:01:39.940
...Jack Atlas will liberate you!

00:01:40.360 --> 00:01:41.380
Let's go!

00:01:43.830 --> 00:01:46.750
In a world split into four dimensions,

00:01:46.750 --> 00:01:50.890
four boys exist, all with the same face.

00:01:51.170 --> 00:01:54.330
Their dragons call to each other,

00:01:54.840 --> 00:01:57.630
almost as if seeking one another.

00:03:31.230 --> 00:03:35.990
The Dragon With Dark Wings

00:03:44.230 --> 00:03:46.000
My turn!

00:03:46.600 --> 00:03:49.260
When there are no monsters 
on my side of the field,

00:03:49.260 --> 00:03:52.480
I can Special Summon Red 
Gargoyle from my hand!

00:03:58.100 --> 00:04:01.830
Then, I summon Tuner Monster Red Resonator.

00:04:03.480 --> 00:04:06.520
In that instant, I activate Red Gargoyle's effect.

00:04:06.520 --> 00:04:09.130
I double Red Resonator's level!

00:04:09.520 --> 00:04:15.100
Level 4 Red Resonator tunes 
Level 4 Red Gargoyle!

00:04:15.420 --> 00:04:18.760
The cry of the champion shakes 
heaven and earth!

00:04:18.760 --> 00:04:22.410
Let the conqueror's unique power 
be carved into your body!

00:04:23.080 --> 00:04:24.540
Synchro Summon.

00:04:24.540 --> 00:04:26.040
The raging soul...

00:04:26.040 --> 00:04:29.030
Scarlight Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:04:35.190 --> 00:04:36.720
Are you guys okay?

00:04:37.020 --> 00:04:38.970
What's that giant dragon?

00:04:38.970 --> 00:04:41.690
In comparison, Red Dragon looks like an ant.

00:04:42.010 --> 00:04:44.260
Is that the Fusion Dimension?

00:04:44.260 --> 00:04:47.370
Damn! At an important time like this, I...

00:04:47.370 --> 00:04:49.200
This is your fault, Crow!

00:04:49.200 --> 00:04:50.410
Crow?

00:04:50.410 --> 00:04:53.570
Yeah. To save me, in the underground facility...

00:05:03.320 --> 00:05:07.650
I'm sure Jack and Gongenzaka will 
get our feelings across to Yuya.

00:05:08.160 --> 00:05:11.620
So let's just watch the show. Right, Crow?

00:05:11.620 --> 00:05:13.310
Yuya Sakaki!

00:05:13.310 --> 00:05:16.590
If your soul still exists, listen to me!

00:05:17.360 --> 00:05:21.570
Wherever you're hiding, I will pull you out.

00:05:22.020 --> 00:05:23.110
Yes.

00:05:23.110 --> 00:05:27.800
Just as you pulled Battle Beast out 
of hiding, from that fortress...

00:05:28.750 --> 00:05:31.880
I will bring you back, in my own way!

00:05:32.200 --> 00:05:35.600
Once per turn, Scarlight Red Dragon Archfiend

00:05:35.600 --> 00:05:40.490
can destroy all Special Summoned monsters 
with fewer attack points than it has.

00:05:40.490 --> 00:05:44.360
For each monster, it deals 
the player 500 damage.

00:05:44.650 --> 00:05:45.150
I—

00:05:45.150 --> 00:05:47.460
Foolish Synchro user...

00:05:47.840 --> 00:05:51.500
I will teach you that it was over,

00:05:51.500 --> 00:05:55.070
the moment you summoned a 
Synchro Monster in front of me.

00:05:55.070 --> 00:05:56.330
What?

00:05:56.530 --> 00:05:57.820
What does he mean?

00:05:57.820 --> 00:06:01.040
Meaning, like how he Xyz 
Summoned on my turn...

00:06:01.440 --> 00:06:03.880
Without a Tuner, under these conditions?

00:06:04.240 --> 00:06:08.460
I tribute two Supreme King Dragon 
Darkwurms on my side of the field,

00:06:08.460 --> 00:06:10.350
to Synchro Summon.

00:06:10.800 --> 00:06:13.180
Retainer of mine, with wings of light,

00:06:13.180 --> 00:06:15.870
strike the enemy with your keen wings!

00:06:16.290 --> 00:06:18.020
Synchro Summon!

00:06:18.020 --> 00:06:21.690
Appear, Supreme King Dragon Clear Wing!

00:06:22.990 --> 00:06:25.390
That's Hugo's...

00:06:25.390 --> 00:06:27.230
It resembles his, but it isn't.

00:06:27.230 --> 00:06:32.160
Besides, Hugo went with Yuya, Yuzu, 
and... What was that guy's name?

00:06:32.160 --> 00:06:33.580
Sawa... Sawa...

00:06:33.580 --> 00:06:34.710
Was someone named that?

00:06:35.220 --> 00:06:38.280
Anyway, Hugo's on our side. 
He isn't our enemy!

00:06:38.540 --> 00:06:40.200
Damn!

00:06:40.200 --> 00:06:41.960
If I could only fight,

00:06:41.960 --> 00:06:46.220
I could tell Hugo to remember the 
entertainment duel we had...

00:06:46.780 --> 00:06:50.400
When Supreme King Dragon Clear 
Wing is Special Summoned,

00:06:50.400 --> 00:06:54.690
I negate all the effects of your 
monsters, and destroy them!

00:06:57.950 --> 00:07:00.730
I send Brutal Red from my hand to my graveyard,

00:07:00.730 --> 00:07:05.180
to negate Scarlight Red Dragon 
Archfiend's destruction,

00:07:05.180 --> 00:07:08.540
and add 1000 to its attack 
points, until my End Phase.

00:07:12.080 --> 00:07:13.400
Yes!

00:07:13.400 --> 00:07:15.310
Red Dragon is safe!

00:07:15.560 --> 00:07:18.030
And he increased its attack points by 1000.

00:07:18.030 --> 00:07:19.550
That's our Jack.

00:07:19.880 --> 00:07:22.020
Let's go, Yuya! Battle!

00:07:22.330 --> 00:07:27.930
Scarlight Red Dragon Archfiend attacks 
Supreme King Dragon Clear Wing!

00:07:28.830 --> 00:07:33.560
Once per turn, Supreme King Dragon 
Clear Wing can negate battle

00:07:33.560 --> 00:07:35.470
and destroy your monster.

00:07:35.800 --> 00:07:39.990
And I deal you that monster's 
attack points as damage!

00:07:40.940 --> 00:07:43.710
The effect of Brutal Red, sent to my graveyard,

00:07:43.710 --> 00:07:47.680
means that Scarlight Red Dragon 
Archfiend cannot be destroyed on this turn!

00:07:49.050 --> 00:07:50.320
He repelled it again.

00:07:50.640 --> 00:07:53.280
Red Dragon Archfiend is Jack's soul.

00:07:53.580 --> 00:07:56.890
As long as it's with Jack, it won't be destroyed!

00:07:56.890 --> 00:08:00.730
But Jack is out of things he can do, this turn.

00:08:01.080 --> 00:08:04.170
I set one card and end my turn.

00:08:04.170 --> 00:08:07.170
In that instant, Brutal Red's effect ends,

00:08:07.170 --> 00:08:11.210
and Scarlight Red Dragon Archfiend's 
attack points return to normal.

00:08:12.670 --> 00:08:14.720
I won't give up, Yuya!

00:08:14.720 --> 00:08:18.340
No matter how often you repel me, 
I'll continue down my road.

00:08:18.340 --> 00:08:22.480
If there's no road, I'll make one. 
Until I reach you!

00:08:22.480 --> 00:08:25.760
It is the man, Gongenzaka, 
who will open that road.

00:08:25.760 --> 00:08:27.100
My turn!

00:08:27.690 --> 00:08:31.660
I summon Tuner Monster Superheavy 
Samurai Battleball from my hand!

00:08:31.960 --> 00:08:35.230
When a Superheavy Samurai 
is on my side of the field,

00:08:35.230 --> 00:08:40.130
I can Special Summon Superhuman 
Samurai Hexagon from my hand!

00:08:43.600 --> 00:08:48.070
Level 2 Battleball tunes Level 6 Hexagon!

00:08:48.710 --> 00:08:52.010
Let the sound of the hammer, which forges 
the blades of historic battles, ring out

00:08:52.350 --> 00:08:55.050
and appear on the battlefield 
where conflagration whirls.

00:08:55.980 --> 00:08:57.480
Synchro Summon!

00:08:58.210 --> 00:09:03.270
Take the field, Level 8 
Superheavy Samurai Swordsmith!

00:09:07.140 --> 00:09:09.640
Another Synchro user?

00:09:09.640 --> 00:09:12.100
But defense position suggests timidity.

00:09:12.440 --> 00:09:14.270
Have you forgotten, Yuya?

00:09:14.270 --> 00:09:17.200
This is how I fight, the immovable duel!

00:09:17.480 --> 00:09:18.900
Immovable?

00:09:19.320 --> 00:09:21.950
If you've forgotten, I'll remind you.

00:09:21.950 --> 00:09:24.670
When I successfully summon Swordsmith,

00:09:24.670 --> 00:09:28.880
I can Special Summon as many Superheavy 
Samurais from my hand, as possible!

00:09:28.880 --> 00:09:32.080
First, Superheavy Samurai Swordsman!

00:09:32.080 --> 00:09:34.980
Then, Superheavy Samurai Blue Brawler!

00:09:36.460 --> 00:09:40.020
And Superheavy Samurai Big Benkei!

00:09:41.990 --> 00:09:43.210
This way!

00:09:44.340 --> 00:09:45.180
Aren't those...

00:09:45.180 --> 00:09:46.930
...Gongenzaka's monsters?

00:09:47.360 --> 00:09:49.400
What's that big dragon?

00:09:49.880 --> 00:09:55.370
Has the Fusion Dimension's invasion, which LDS 
warned us about, finally begun?

00:09:59.310 --> 00:10:00.510
Look, Yuya!

00:10:01.020 --> 00:10:05.350
The monsters lined up here are heroes 
of history that you have fought!

00:10:05.890 --> 00:10:08.780
To refine the entertainment duel, 
inherited from your father,

00:10:08.780 --> 00:10:13.400
and the immovable duels taught 
by the Gongenzaka Dojo,

00:10:13.830 --> 00:10:16.030
we've fought together since childhood,

00:10:16.350 --> 00:10:18.230
growing bigger and stronger.

00:10:18.930 --> 00:10:23.180
Those days of passion remain inscribed 
upon my heart forever.

00:10:24.270 --> 00:10:26.970
Surely, you feel the same way, Yuya!

00:10:27.330 --> 00:10:29.640
Entertainment... Immovable...

00:10:29.640 --> 00:10:30.440
Yes!

00:10:30.960 --> 00:10:34.440
I will reawaken your entertainer's soul, Yuya.

00:10:34.440 --> 00:10:37.360
Attack me, as you did back then.

00:10:37.360 --> 00:10:39.920
I will block it with my immovable duel...

00:10:40.500 --> 00:10:42.790
I now end my turn.

00:10:43.810 --> 00:10:44.660
Nonsense.

00:10:44.660 --> 00:10:50.040
Even if you attack Jack's Scarlight 
Red Dragon Archfiend,

00:10:50.040 --> 00:10:51.760
I will protect it!

00:10:52.280 --> 00:10:53.870
Even if I must let you cut my flesh.

00:10:54.120 --> 00:10:55.570
Cut your flesh?

00:10:55.570 --> 00:11:01.040
Yes... Superheavy Samurai Swordsmith 
will protect Red Dragon.

00:11:01.320 --> 00:11:05.840
I see. And then, with the Scarlight Red 
Dragon Archfiend you protected,

00:11:05.840 --> 00:11:07.250
I will strike his bones.

00:11:07.830 --> 00:11:11.220
That is what it means to open the road for me.

00:11:13.010 --> 00:11:14.450
What's so funny?!

00:11:14.800 --> 00:11:16.890
Planning to work together?

00:11:17.890 --> 00:11:18.920
Fools.

00:11:19.200 --> 00:11:22.390
You'll see if we're fools or not, once you attack!

00:11:22.390 --> 00:11:24.440
Now, Z-ARC...

00:11:24.440 --> 00:11:26.280
No... Yuya!

00:11:26.280 --> 00:11:28.370
Fight me, with your entertainment!

00:11:28.370 --> 00:11:33.070
Very well. But my entertainment 
can get a little rough.

00:11:33.990 --> 00:11:34.970
What?

00:11:34.970 --> 00:11:36.810
Z-ARC's entertainment?

00:11:36.810 --> 00:11:38.480
Is that a reaction...

00:11:38.480 --> 00:11:40.550
...from the Yuya inside of him?

00:11:40.980 --> 00:11:43.110
My turn!

00:11:43.110 --> 00:11:46.580
I activate Equip Spell Supreme 
Presence from my hand!

00:11:46.860 --> 00:11:49.420
I equip it to Supreme Dragon Clear Wing!

00:11:49.990 --> 00:11:53.420
Just as you wish, I'll attack your monster...

00:11:53.420 --> 00:11:54.490
Battle.

00:11:54.490 --> 00:11:58.860
Supreme Dragon Clear Wing 
attacks Big Benkei!

00:11:59.150 --> 00:12:05.050
In that instant, Clear Wing negates 
battle and destroys Benkei,

00:12:05.050 --> 00:12:07.840
dealing its attack points as damage to you.

00:12:08.220 --> 00:12:15.080
Equip Spell Supreme Presence causes 
this to affect all of your monsters!

00:12:15.550 --> 00:12:17.520
What? All of them?

00:12:18.210 --> 00:12:19.420
But then, they'll all...

00:12:19.420 --> 00:12:20.350
...be destroyed.

00:12:20.350 --> 00:12:21.930
Is this Z-ARC's...

00:12:21.930 --> 00:12:23.290
...entertainment?

00:12:23.560 --> 00:12:26.360
Please, Crow... Protect them!

00:12:36.850 --> 00:12:40.250
When one of my cards is destroyed 
during the Battle Phase,

00:12:40.250 --> 00:12:42.670
I can tribute a Superheavy Samurai on the field,

00:12:42.670 --> 00:12:45.880
to summon Superheavy Samurai 
Warchief Heavystrong

00:12:45.880 --> 00:12:47.680
from my hand, in defense position!

00:12:56.790 --> 00:13:00.390
Protect Jack's soul, Heavystrong!

00:13:00.990 --> 00:13:05.610
Heavystrong negates the 
destruction of two cards!

00:13:14.040 --> 00:13:16.470
Jack... Gongenzaka...

00:13:16.830 --> 00:13:18.060
What happened to Gongenzaka?

00:13:18.060 --> 00:13:18.940
What happened?

00:13:19.240 --> 00:13:23.120
I'm not sure. But Jack was once the King.

00:13:23.120 --> 00:13:24.650
He won't be finished like that.

00:13:24.650 --> 00:13:26.120
Look!

00:13:31.290 --> 00:13:35.080
I took the total attack points of 
the three destroyed monsters,

00:13:35.080 --> 00:13:37.260
1000 points of damage.

00:13:37.580 --> 00:13:43.730
But Heavystrong's effect protected 
itself and Scarlight.

00:13:43.730 --> 00:13:48.340
And Heavystrong's effect also 
ends the Battle Phase!

00:13:48.340 --> 00:13:50.270
Did you see that, Crow?

00:13:50.270 --> 00:13:51.400
He did it...

00:13:51.400 --> 00:13:55.520
Gongenzaka protected Jack's 
dragon, even from that!

00:13:55.520 --> 00:13:57.550
You're amazing, Gongenzaka!

00:14:01.420 --> 00:14:03.030
Yeah!

00:14:04.840 --> 00:14:06.140
What's that?

00:14:06.860 --> 00:14:08.980
What the heck?!

00:14:21.350 --> 00:14:22.470
Is that...

00:14:22.470 --> 00:14:23.740
City...

00:14:23.740 --> 00:14:26.260
The Synchro Dimension town is here.

00:14:29.080 --> 00:14:31.980
Wh-What the heck?

00:14:38.710 --> 00:14:40.760
Wasn't that interesting?

00:14:40.760 --> 00:14:43.330
I'm impressed that you endured 
my entertainment.

00:14:43.780 --> 00:14:45.300
You have my compliments.

00:14:45.780 --> 00:14:48.280
Your laughter will end soon enough!

00:14:48.280 --> 00:14:51.880
Scarlight Red Dragon Archfiend,

00:14:51.880 --> 00:14:54.140
protected by Gongenzaka's sacrifice,

00:14:54.140 --> 00:14:57.980
will surely pierce that thick armor of yours!

00:14:58.450 --> 00:14:59.900
Jack's heading for the highway...

00:14:59.900 --> 00:15:02.180
But will it have substance?

00:15:02.180 --> 00:15:05.150
The dimensional fusion isn't fully complete.

00:15:05.440 --> 00:15:07.390
But Jack isn't hesitating!

00:15:07.390 --> 00:15:09.630
I believe he can ride it, too!

00:15:09.630 --> 00:15:12.260
Drive all the way to Yuya, Jack!

00:15:23.350 --> 00:15:24.340
He did it!

00:15:28.720 --> 00:15:30.510
My turn!

00:15:32.790 --> 00:15:36.350
I activate my trap card Vision Synchro.

00:15:36.350 --> 00:15:41.180
Its effect lets me send Red Sprinter 
and two Tuner Monsters,

00:15:41.180 --> 00:15:44.520
Dark Resonator and Net Resonator, 
from my hand to my graveyard,

00:15:44.520 --> 00:15:46.260
to Synchro Summon.

00:15:46.680 --> 00:15:48.960
Synchro Summoning with monsters in his hand?

00:15:48.960 --> 00:15:51.430
Listen to the beat of my soul!

00:15:51.760 --> 00:15:54.900
Do you feel it? The exhilaration of my life!

00:15:54.900 --> 00:15:56.720
Behold, Yuya...

00:15:56.720 --> 00:15:58.370
This is my duel!

00:15:58.720 --> 00:16:04.340
And remember our duel that 
painted City in blazing red!

00:16:04.720 --> 00:16:09.320
Level 3 Dark Resonator

00:16:09.320 --> 00:16:13.820
and Net Resonator Double Tune 
Level 4 Red Sprinter!

00:16:13.820 --> 00:16:17.290
Champion and demon, merge here and now!

00:16:17.290 --> 00:16:21.800
Touch the red dragon's soul and raise the 
cry that creates heaven and earth!

00:16:22.290 --> 00:16:24.030
Synchro Summon!

00:16:24.280 --> 00:16:28.220
Appear, Level 10 Tyrant Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:16:33.500 --> 00:16:34.880
Wow!

00:16:34.880 --> 00:16:37.470
He did a Synchro Summon from his hand!

00:16:37.470 --> 00:16:39.210
And a Double Tune, on top of it!

00:16:39.580 --> 00:16:43.680
Now, he has two Red Dragons! 
There's no way he'll lose!

00:16:43.680 --> 00:16:48.290
I activate the effect of Net Resonator, 
used as a component to summon Tyrant.

00:16:48.650 --> 00:16:52.760
As long as Tyrant is on the field, 
I cannot take effect damage!

00:16:52.760 --> 00:16:59.230
I activate Heavystrong's effect, 
targeting Scarlight and Tyrant!

00:16:59.600 --> 00:17:03.790
This prevents either monster from being 
destroyed until the End Phase!

00:17:04.200 --> 00:17:07.040
This is everything that I can do.

00:17:07.460 --> 00:17:08.680
Please, Jack...

00:17:09.140 --> 00:17:13.240
With the dragons of your soul, reawaken Yuya's heart.

00:17:13.560 --> 00:17:15.210
Go, Jack!

00:17:15.580 --> 00:17:17.920
Please! Finish this, Jack!

00:17:19.760 --> 00:17:20.760
Battle.

00:17:20.760 --> 00:17:26.500
Red Dragon Scarlight Archfiend attacks 
Supreme King Dragon Clear Wing!

00:17:29.560 --> 00:17:31.820
It's all the same, no matter what you do.

00:17:31.820 --> 00:17:37.500
Once per turn, Clear Wing can negate 
battle and destroy your monster!

00:17:37.880 --> 00:17:41.540
Due to Heavystrong's effect, 
Scarlight can't be destroyed!

00:17:42.000 --> 00:17:43.970
But that will end, too.

00:17:44.410 --> 00:17:49.850
Supreme Presence's effect means that 
Clear Wing's effect targets all monsters.

00:17:49.850 --> 00:17:55.640
Heavystrong is destroyed, and you take 
damage equal to its attack points!

00:17:59.190 --> 00:18:03.160
But Jack won't take damage, thanks to 
Net Resonator's effect!

00:18:15.210 --> 00:18:16.910
Crow! Damn it!

00:18:16.910 --> 00:18:19.880
Where did you go? Hey, Crow!

00:18:23.050 --> 00:18:24.350
Gongenzaka!

00:18:28.820 --> 00:18:31.080
Go, Jack...

00:18:31.520 --> 00:18:32.730
Yuya!

00:18:32.730 --> 00:18:36.990
Your friend has sacrificed himself 
to give me this chance.

00:18:36.990 --> 00:18:39.460
With those feelings behind me, 
I shall strike you!

00:18:39.850 --> 00:18:43.430
Take it, Yuya... This strike from my soul!

00:18:45.170 --> 00:18:50.160
Tyrant Red Dragon Archfiend attacks Clear Wing.

00:18:50.160 --> 00:18:53.640
Inferno Crimson Hell Tide!

00:18:57.620 --> 00:18:59.080
Yeah!

00:18:59.080 --> 00:19:00.670
But once again...

00:19:00.670 --> 00:19:02.420
Z-ARC's life will...

00:19:02.700 --> 00:19:05.760
As long as a Supreme King 
Monster is on my field,

00:19:06.060 --> 00:19:10.490
Supreme King Gate Zero's Pendulum 
Effect prevents damage to me.

00:19:10.490 --> 00:19:11.960
What?

00:19:11.960 --> 00:19:14.890
And Supreme King Gate Infinity's effect

00:19:14.890 --> 00:19:19.440
increases my life by the damage 
that would have been dealt!

00:19:23.140 --> 00:19:26.120
I end my turn.

00:19:26.120 --> 00:19:29.610
In that instant, Vision Synchro's effect ends,

00:19:29.610 --> 00:19:33.480
and Tyrant Red Dragon Archfiend 
is returned to my Extra Deck.

00:19:34.380 --> 00:19:37.360
An effect that negates damage 
and restores his life...

00:19:37.360 --> 00:19:41.820
In a situation this bad, why wouldn't 
Crow come to save Yuya?

00:19:41.820 --> 00:19:44.060
Where have you gone, Crow?

00:19:44.430 --> 00:19:46.030
Hey, are you all right?

00:19:46.030 --> 00:19:47.380
Speak to me.

00:19:49.440 --> 00:19:53.270
He reacted to the word "entertainment."

00:19:53.780 --> 00:19:54.840
Yuya's in there.

00:19:55.200 --> 00:19:56.400
You can call him back.

00:19:56.400 --> 00:19:57.540
Gongenzaka...

00:19:57.540 --> 00:19:59.640
You're the only one left!

00:20:00.080 --> 00:20:02.660
Please, Sawatari... Bring Yuya back.

00:20:03.250 --> 00:20:06.600
Someone else who can fight is here!

00:20:09.750 --> 00:20:11.560
Y-You're...

00:20:11.560 --> 00:20:13.420
My turn!

00:20:14.700 --> 00:20:18.500
You've given me the most fun yet.

00:20:18.930 --> 00:20:21.730
Thus, I will give you the honor 
of destruction at my hands...

00:20:22.180 --> 00:20:24.570
Under the name of despair!

00:20:24.570 --> 00:20:26.540
We're tagging in, too!

00:20:26.810 --> 00:20:29.510
2000-point penalty for entering the battle.

00:20:30.430 --> 00:20:31.140
Battle.

00:20:31.460 --> 00:20:34.850
I attack Scarlight Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:21:10.180 --> 00:21:11.540
You two...

00:21:12.050 --> 00:21:14.470
I leave it to you.

00:21:15.390 --> 00:21:17.090
Yeah, leave it to me.

00:21:17.370 --> 00:21:21.150
Ultimately, super, ultra, hyper-strong duelist

00:21:21.150 --> 00:21:24.430
Shingo Sawatari will finish this off!

00:21:25.460 --> 00:21:28.860
I won't let you hog all the spotlight!

00:21:31.840 --> 00:21:32.840
That's...

00:21:32.840 --> 00:21:33.850
...Crow!

00:21:33.850 --> 00:21:36.070
I knew he was there! Crow's there!

00:21:36.070 --> 00:21:39.020
Crow... He's back to life?

00:21:39.020 --> 00:21:40.150
How?

00:21:40.910 --> 00:21:46.150
When the promised land is created, 
the people there will be reborn...

00:21:52.160 --> 00:21:53.130
No way!

00:21:53.700 --> 00:21:54.790
Father's...

00:21:55.180 --> 00:21:56.940
What's this about Leo Akaba?

00:21:56.940 --> 00:21:58.400
Did Ray say something?

00:21:58.400 --> 00:22:02.600
"Father is trying to separate the worlds again.

00:22:03.220 --> 00:22:07.540
With the four cards brought back in my place..."

00:22:07.840 --> 00:22:09.460
Four cards?

00:23:48.880 --> 00:23:52.080
Now, come! New duelists!

00:23:52.080 --> 00:23:56.380
This world's ruin is my ultimate entertainment!

00:23:56.950 --> 00:23:59.640
If you wish to stop me, then try!

00:23:59.640 --> 00:24:01.530
Ruin of this world, my eye...

00:24:01.530 --> 00:24:03.750
That isn't entertainment!

00:24:03.750 --> 00:24:06.200
Vassal with different-colored eyes,

00:24:06.200 --> 00:24:09.530
use your two sharp eyes to burn our enemies!

00:24:10.560 --> 00:24:14.400
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V: 
Eyes Stained in Darkness.

00:24:14.850 --> 00:24:16.870
The fun is only getting started!
